'''WAVE BUSTERS''' is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in Battle Cats. This event contains [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Blocker]] and [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave Immune]] Uber Rare Cats from other events. This event was added in 9.7 of BCJP.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 5%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 70%
}}

